#hosmer-lemeshow: X-squared = 11.519, df = 8, p = 0.174
#p > 0.05, h0 not rejected, model fits the data adequately
#deviance and pearson residuals show no systematic pattern around 0
#44 observations flagged as influential by cooks distance (threshold 4/768 = 0.0052)
#influential observations are present but not unexpected for a dataset of this size
#limitations: skinthickness and insulin excluded due to high missingness, predictive information lost
#age showed non-linearity in task 2, linear logistic model may not fully capture this
#dataset consists exclusively of pima indian women aged 21+, external validity is limited
#results should not be generalised to other populations, men, or younger women
